<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable/Iowa started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable/Iowa started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Ed Spehar said he initiated coverage of Equitable of Iowa Cos with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 39-3/4.  </p>
<p>-- Spehar said that low cost structure allowed for above average returns in a competative fixed annuity market.</p>
<p>-- he said that substantial surrender charge protection suggested high returns were sustainable.</p>
<p>-- he said variable annuities provided diversification but not a reason to buy the stock.</p>
<p>-- he forecast double-digit earnings growth, but a slowdown from the historical rate.</p>
<p>-- he said large insider ownership meant that management and shareholder interests are aligned.</p>
</text>
